{"server":"cn","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_02_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_02","title":"叛乱前哨","storyCode":"TW-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"e031083f0938dee2c4a6418fc7d99d83610cc9852397549e649539193a5e8576","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 2下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——他们是什么时候潜上来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚，但是“留声机”没有启动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我早说过那种实验性的自律施术单元装置不靠谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"只要那些感染者队伍里有其他受过高等教育的莱塔尼亚人，篡夺它们，很简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"现在说这个也来不及了，感染者居住区到处都有他们的踪迹，呃，他们在煽动感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃伦姆德的居民都不会那么轻易被煽动起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可的确有越来越多人开始抗议，他们聚集在一起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"什么诉求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"他们要求恢复十二音街道的物资供应......还要求我们撤销对十二音街道的所有隔离措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......简直胡闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，最关键的......还是他们要求对火灾一事给出正式回应......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他们根本不关心火灾......看着吧，很快所有人都会忘记这个初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办？罗德岛的人也已经抵达了，暴露只是时间问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我们都清楚，不然我为什么要让塔佳娜去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过在向罗德岛摊牌之前，我们得确定他们是一个什么样的公司......确定他们是安托那样的感染者，还是“他们”那样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定这么做对不对......让她们发现我们在隐瞒难道不会加剧分歧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......随你怎么想吧，会翻脸的人总会翻脸的，现在沃伦姆德什么情况，你我心知肚明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"这我清楚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——那就别指望当什么好人了，好人下场都不太好，结果更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳......那些真正麻烦的家伙们呢？比如魔族之类的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还没有和我们正式接触......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"一群趁火打劫的劫匪，煽动镇民，创造空隙，很常见的伎俩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他们很谨慎，在试探虚实，如果让他们确信现在的沃伦姆德没有宪兵队驻扎的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"这里每一个人都做好了战斗的准备，我们还有L-44“留声机”防御系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们毕竟不是真正的宪兵......唉，我只想少出点人命，咳咳——咳咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"请保重身体，沃伦姆德还不能失去你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗，我倒觉得无所谓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"还有谁能在其实一个宪兵都没有的情况下，保证沃伦姆德的治安环境不至于崩溃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"只是倔强的血统作祟罢了，高贵的莱塔尼亚人放不下身段行龌龊之事，只要再推他们一把，这里就会变成人间地狱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"再不想出办法，我们很快就会玩完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在入冬之前，我们得回到正常的航线，而不是继续停留在这片废土上，饥荒和暴动会毁了这座城镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，嗯......你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"天已经转凉了，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......但愿沃伦姆德还有其他的选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你们两个是哪里来的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也要帮着这些蠢货吗，把我们关在这里等死！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"安分点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才你们在听谁说话？你们告诉了他什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怕了吗？这就对了！你们当然会怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为你们这些吃官饭的那么无能，沃伦姆德才会沦落到今天的样子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，不如让我们亲自来掌控一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是任何人的错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"把责任怪给天灾就完事儿了吗！？本来就是因为你们的失误，我们才没来得及跑掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这是无理取闹，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你去过其他城市吗？你见过其他感染者生活的处境吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是我也能看出沃伦姆德的窘境，其他人和感染者过着一样的日子，这不正是需要携手并进的紧要关头吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？你又是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛干员，感染者医生，我们会帮助感染者们渡过难关，前提是，不要惹是生非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你好，可以的话，请放弃抵抗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！还不是在仗势欺人，要不是我打不过你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"携手并进，帮助？说得好听，是谁先开始反目成仇的，你问问那个女人吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，你，你也是感染者吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"有着九条尾巴的沃尔珀可不常见，你迟早也会沦落到我这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事......大家都对我很好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不是在现在，就算不是在这里，也迟早会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"如果安托医生还在的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！你干什么，松手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐，冷静一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才说，你刚才说安托医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"她现在在哪儿？她怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"什么她在哪儿，那场火灾夺走了一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"大裂谷出现之后他们就开始排挤我们，他们在恐惧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"那些逃难来的感染者也被他们聚集在一起！为什么，为了控制住我们，为了让他们虚伪的人道精神满足，他们把我们豢养了起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有......塞弗林长官从来没有这种想法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，随你的便吧，如果只是这样......只是这样我们也满足了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"至少有安托医生，至少我们还能有同伴，就算你们放弃了这条街道，我们也有地方可住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——他们——他们害死了安托医生，害死了我们的同伴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为那场大火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"——你、你要怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......安托应该从那场火灾里活下来了才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我懂了，是这样，他们也骗了你们。对，他们骗了所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"那才不是什么事故，那是纵火，是谋杀！是这些平时道貌岸然的家伙们露出真面目的证据！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要你情绪化的宣泄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"呿，你知道吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"——火灾发生的那一天，根本没有一个人从那个帐篷里逃出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你知道，你该站在哪边了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！你就不知道下手轻点——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......冷静点，你被捕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不是宪兵！你们都不是！这里根本没有法律！这里只有移民者留下的残羹剩饭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林长官会决定你的下场的，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你们不敢杀我，杀了我就等于和这里所有的感染者居民决裂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"我就等着你们把我流放到荒原上，这样我就能正式加入那些——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还有你的同伙，你们都认定是我们主导了这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我们都是这里的居民，明明我们都是沃伦姆德的一份子，明明那么多年来都能相安无事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你们宁可信任那些徘徊在荒野里的可疑感染者，也不愿意信任我们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有哪里做得不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为你不是冬灵的一份子，你也不是感染者，你安然无恙，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了感染者是什么，也别忘了矿石病是什么，现在我比你更清楚，仅此而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"民兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！塔佳娜在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"民兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"还有罗德岛的二位，你们没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我们没事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"请把他们带走，麻烦各位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛乱的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，又要去见塞弗林......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"民兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会确保他们不再犯事的，可塔佳娜小姐，罗德岛的二位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我会负责的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"民兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"——好的，那我们就先走一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，可以给我一个解释吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我会告诉二位全部的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我不知道塞弗林长官和代表们是怎么想的，但我觉得......亚叶小姐，铃兰小姐，你们应该得知真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"何况你们刚刚帮了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......多说无用，我只想知道......她还活着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不确定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不确定！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐，别这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜小姐......为什么要说谎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们自己都还没有做好准备接受这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"请理解，我们并不知道罗德岛是个什么样的公司，我们应该先取得信任——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算我们冷血，我们无情，我们会让沃伦姆德雪上加霜——这也不是你欺瞒我同伴下场的借口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我很抱歉，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"我们并不打算一直瞒着你们......！我们、我们也有在努力调查那些可疑的感染者份子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我明白的，这都是为了自保而已，这不是借口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说得没错，这只是借口而已。但也......无可厚非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想......我只想知道真相。罗德岛不会抛下你们，抛下因感染者问题深陷困境的一座城镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"否则安托会不高兴的，她一不高兴就要哭鼻子，我不喜欢她哭的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还不算太迟，对你我来说都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"帮助感染者，解决感染者问题，这就是我们罗德岛干员的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塔佳娜小姐，如果我们互相信任，可以做到更多的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"在天灾发生前，长官曾经问过安托医生，要不要跟着难民们一起离开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"当时安托医生说的也是——“罗德岛不会抛下你们的。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"请跟我来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亚叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["铃兰"]}]}
